<div class="bhd-page__prose-grid">
  <article class="bhd-page__prose">
    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">What is not on the list</p>
    <h2>Magnesium is important physiology, but not a current Best Hydrate ingredient</h2>
    <p>Magnesium participates in hundreds of enzymatic reactions and is an important physiological ion. However, the current Best Hydrate Lemonade ingredient list does not contain a magnesium salt. We therefore do not count magnesium among the electrolyte species supplied by the product.</p>
    <p>The same principle applies to calcium and phosphate: they matter to human physiology, but a general list of biologically important electrolytes is not the same thing as the ingredient profile of a particular hydration product.</p>
  </article>
  <aside class="bhd-page__callout">
    <span class="bhd-page__callout-label">Transparent by design</span>
    <h3>Count what is actually in the formula.</h3>
    <p>We would rather explain a short ingredient list precisely than imply a broader mineral panel for marketing purposes.</p>
  </aside>
</div>

