    <h2>Five highlighted electrolyte species, one integrated hydration formula</h2>
    <p>The value of the formula is not that each ion works independently. Sodium, glucose, water and the other dissolved species exist together in one solution. Their concentrations, ratios, taste and tolerability determine how the prepared drink behaves in actual use.</p>
